1
00:01:30,566 --> 00:01:31,551
=Tigers Sniff the Rose=

2
00:01:31,551 --> 00:01:33,560
(Based on the novel of the same name by Yiren Kuikui)

3
00:01:35,660 --> 00:01:38,260
=Episode 39=

4
00:01:44,080 --> 00:01:44,570
Come on.

5
00:01:45,130 --> 00:01:47,290
I've come up with a good solution.

6
00:01:48,360 --> 00:01:49,050
If...

7
00:01:49,850 --> 00:01:52,130
If Mu Xun catches up with me...

8
00:01:53,440 --> 00:01:55,720
Chancellor Liu and Yan Shang
are both dead anyway.

9
00:01:56,960 --> 00:01:57,690
I'll just say

10
00:01:58,320 --> 00:01:59,690
it was Mu Wanyao!

11
00:02:00,440 --> 00:02:01,930
She's the real usurper!

12
00:02:04,880 --> 00:02:05,770
Yan Shang is dead?

13
00:02:06,520 --> 00:02:06,770
I...

14
00:02:07,770 --> 00:02:10,040
I was forced to flee to Hangzhou!

15
00:02:11,040 --> 00:02:13,480
I... I can give him back the throne.

16
00:02:15,880 --> 00:02:16,640
How did he die?

17
00:02:17,920 --> 00:02:18,720
It's settled, then.

18
00:02:19,040 --> 00:02:20,090
I'll definitely survive!

19
00:02:20,370 --> 00:02:21,640
I'll definitely survive!

20
00:02:22,410 --> 00:02:24,160
Sitting on this throne

21
00:02:24,480 --> 00:02:26,130
is like sitting on a brazier.

22
00:02:26,810 --> 00:02:28,040
It's burning my backside!

23
00:02:30,010 --> 00:02:30,440
Oh, right.

24
00:02:31,480 --> 00:02:32,370
Before I leave,

25
00:02:33,530 --> 00:02:34,880
there's one more thing to do

26
00:02:36,410 --> 00:02:37,690
to make absolutely sure I'm safe.

27
00:02:40,410 --> 00:02:42,320
I'll abdicate in favor of Si'er.

28
00:02:43,640 --> 00:02:45,160
I'll become the Retired Emperor!

29
00:02:48,970 --> 00:02:49,690
What did Your Majesty

30
00:02:51,480 --> 00:02:52,090
just say?

31
00:02:53,850 --> 00:02:55,570
I'll abdicate in favor of Si'er.

32
00:02:56,760 --> 00:02:58,530
I'll become the Retired Emperor!

33
00:02:59,760 --> 00:03:00,370
Think about it.

34
00:03:01,320 --> 00:03:02,810
If Mu Xun catches up with me,

35
00:03:03,160 --> 00:03:05,640
he won't kill a Retired Emperor.

36
00:03:12,810 --> 00:03:13,410
Yes, yes.

37
00:03:14,880 --> 00:03:15,290
Exactly.

38
00:03:16,370 --> 00:03:17,090
So...

39
00:03:19,290 --> 00:03:20,880
You'll put Si'er in harm's way

40
00:03:22,440 --> 00:03:24,010
to die in your place?

41
00:03:28,090 --> 00:03:28,480
Come on!

42
00:03:29,040 --> 00:03:29,920
Draft the edict

43
00:03:30,370 --> 00:03:31,090
for me right now.

44
00:03:31,200 --> 00:03:31,920
There's no time to lose!

45
00:03:35,920 --> 00:03:36,320
Wait.

46
00:03:39,690 --> 00:03:40,290
What if...

47
00:03:41,920 --> 00:03:43,530
What if Sheng'an doesn't fall,

48
00:03:44,880 --> 00:03:46,250
and this was all a false alarm?

49
00:03:47,570 --> 00:03:50,200
What if Mu Wanyao comes back?

50
00:03:51,290 --> 00:03:51,690
Then what?

51
00:03:54,530 --> 00:03:55,200
Si'er...

52
00:03:56,090 --> 00:03:56,880
Chunhua...

53
00:03:57,440 --> 00:03:58,530
The emperor is young,
and his mother is strong.

54
00:03:59,410 --> 00:04:01,949
Chunhua and Mu Wanyao are in league.

55
00:04:01,991 --> 00:04:02,831
What if...

56
00:04:03,690 --> 00:04:06,440
What if she helps Wanyao seize Si'er?

57
00:04:06,810 --> 00:04:07,090
Then...

58
00:04:08,810 --> 00:04:10,130
then this edict

59
00:04:10,970 --> 00:04:13,640
would be my death warrant.

60
00:04:15,320 --> 00:04:16,440
Your Majesty,

61
00:04:18,280 --> 00:04:19,760
how thoughtful of you now.

62
00:04:22,610 --> 00:04:23,080
Come here!

63
00:04:27,370 --> 00:04:28,370
Write this down.

64
00:04:29,760 --> 00:04:31,200
I'll abdicate at once.

65
00:04:32,320 --> 00:04:32,810
And

66
00:04:35,050 --> 00:04:36,840
order the Noble Consort's execution.

67
00:04:43,130 --> 00:04:43,760
Hurry up!

68
00:04:45,080 --> 00:04:45,960
Why aren't you moving?

69
00:04:46,490 --> 00:04:47,170
You don't expect me

70
00:04:47,760 --> 00:04:50,349
to take Chunhua to Hangzhou, do you?

71
00:04:50,391 --> 00:04:51,751
There's no time!

72
00:04:52,130 --> 00:04:53,400
Cui Quan is preparing the carriage.

73
00:04:53,930 --> 00:04:56,200
I must leave in an hour!

74
00:04:56,370 --> 00:04:57,170
And before that,

75
00:04:58,080 --> 00:04:59,690
she must be executed!

76
00:05:01,250 --> 00:05:01,840
Quick!

77
00:05:18,760 --> 00:05:19,640
Once you've drafted the edict,

78
00:05:20,960 --> 00:05:21,960
carry out the order for me and hang her.

79
00:05:22,810 --> 00:05:24,280
Where's my imperial seal?

80
00:05:27,170 --> 00:05:29,010
Where has my seal gone?

81
00:05:42,490 --> 00:05:43,280
Found it!

82
00:05:54,610 --> 00:05:54,960
Don't!

83
00:06:38,250 --> 00:06:39,400
You've committed

84
00:06:40,440 --> 00:06:41,810
far too many evil deeds.

85
00:06:45,840 --> 00:06:46,840
You've ruined

86
00:06:47,520 --> 00:06:48,520
Chunhua's life,

87
00:06:48,960 --> 00:06:50,370
and mine too!

88
00:07:04,010 --> 00:07:04,610
Your Majesty,

89
00:07:05,520 --> 00:07:07,170
when are we leaving?

90
00:07:22,690 --> 00:07:24,200
His Majesty needs a little more time.

91
00:07:26,730 --> 00:07:28,010
Attendant Liu,

92
00:07:28,440 --> 00:07:29,170
you're here?

93
00:07:30,730 --> 00:07:32,280
His Majesty wants to see the consort.

94
00:07:33,490 --> 00:07:34,570
Send for her immediately.

95
00:08:18,760 --> 00:08:19,250
Chunhua,

96
00:08:21,080 --> 00:08:21,570
come with me.

97
00:08:32,490 --> 00:08:32,730
Come.

98
00:08:34,280 --> 00:08:34,640
Look.

99
00:08:45,640 --> 00:08:46,130
Don't be afraid.

100
00:08:47,920 --> 00:08:48,370
Don't be afraid.

101
00:08:51,800 --> 00:08:52,680
He's dead now.

102
00:08:56,850 --> 00:08:58,040
I'm finally free.

103
00:09:00,880 --> 00:09:01,520
Wenji,

104
00:09:02,490 --> 00:09:03,760
you've committed regicide.

105
00:09:13,680 --> 00:09:14,090
Chunhua,

106
00:09:18,210 --> 00:09:19,370
stay and talk with me for a while.

107
00:09:35,680 --> 00:09:36,210
Chunhua,

108
00:09:39,010 --> 00:09:39,640
do you know

109
00:09:41,680 --> 00:09:43,610
why I never proposed to you back then?

110
00:09:48,010 --> 00:09:49,040
Perhaps

111
00:09:50,450 --> 00:09:52,880
I hadn't made you love me enough.

112
00:10:06,730 --> 00:10:07,130
No.

113
00:10:10,280 --> 00:10:11,090
It was because

114
00:10:13,730 --> 00:10:14,800
I was weak,

115
00:10:16,640 --> 00:10:17,330
selfish,

116
00:10:19,160 --> 00:10:20,250
and a coward.

117
00:10:30,280 --> 00:10:32,520
I knew you were a maid,

118
00:10:33,880 --> 00:10:35,330
not a noblewoman from Sheng'an.

119
00:10:36,880 --> 00:10:37,610
And I was frustrated.

120
00:10:41,800 --> 00:10:42,680
I reserved

121
00:10:44,280 --> 00:10:46,090
the place of my lawful wife

122
00:10:47,130 --> 00:10:48,640
until I'd passed the imperial exam,

123
00:10:50,520 --> 00:10:51,610
so I could marry

124
00:10:53,010 --> 00:10:53,680
a noblewoman

125
00:10:54,850 --> 00:10:57,040
from one of the great clans.

126
00:11:11,040 --> 00:11:12,400
I've often wondered over the years...

127
00:11:17,680 --> 00:11:19,800
If I'd proposed to you back then,

128
00:11:21,850 --> 00:11:23,330
none of this would have happened.

129
00:11:24,680 --> 00:11:26,250
The night Si'er was born,

130
00:11:31,560 --> 00:11:33,330
the life we dreamed of together

131
00:11:34,330 --> 00:11:35,610
could have been real.

132
00:11:55,400 --> 00:11:55,880
Chunhua,

133
00:11:58,010 --> 00:11:58,760
you must be

134
00:12:01,330 --> 00:12:02,210
so disappointed in me.

135
00:12:34,850 --> 00:12:36,400
Forgive my boldness,

136
00:12:37,210 --> 00:12:38,760
but when will His Majesty

137
00:12:39,370 --> 00:12:40,850
and the Noble Consort depart?

138
00:12:44,250 --> 00:12:46,130
His Majesty and I must speak in private.

139
00:12:46,490 --> 00:12:47,130
No one is to come in!

140
00:13:06,520 --> 00:13:07,450
Wenji, what's wrong?

141
00:13:08,490 --> 00:13:09,280
Did you poison yourself?

142
00:13:09,680 --> 00:13:10,210
Wenji!

143
00:13:16,850 --> 00:13:17,130
I...

144
00:13:19,040 --> 00:13:20,040
I feel terrible...

145
00:13:23,560 --> 00:13:24,010
Chunhua,

146
00:13:26,280 --> 00:13:26,920
please let me

147
00:13:28,400 --> 00:13:29,330
rest in your arms

148
00:13:30,280 --> 00:13:31,250
for a little while.

149
00:13:51,800 --> 00:13:52,880
He deserved to die.

150
00:13:55,370 --> 00:13:57,280
But you shouldn't have died with him.

151
00:13:58,250 --> 00:13:59,010
It's not worth it.

152
00:14:05,970 --> 00:14:06,800
It is worth it.

153
00:14:09,330 --> 00:14:10,400
Only with him dead

154
00:14:12,400 --> 00:14:13,370
can you and Si'er

155
00:14:15,040 --> 00:14:16,800
live safely and in peace.

156
00:14:17,250 --> 00:14:19,010
But all I want is for you to live!

157
00:14:30,880 --> 00:14:31,610
Don't cry.

158
00:14:35,880 --> 00:14:36,400
Please don't cry.

159
00:16:10,800 --> 00:16:11,680
You're so beautiful.

160
00:16:25,130 --> 00:16:25,520
Wenji!

161
00:16:26,490 --> 00:16:26,920
Wenji!

162
00:16:29,370 --> 00:16:29,970
Wenji!

163
00:16:38,330 --> 00:16:38,880
Wenji.

164
00:16:42,640 --> 00:16:44,160
The first time I met you,

165
00:16:46,250 --> 00:16:47,680
I fell in love with you.

166
00:16:48,320 --> 00:16:51,280
♪Why must this world know joy and pain?♪

167
00:16:52,490 --> 00:16:54,069
But only after returning to Sheng'an

168
00:16:54,111 --> 00:16:55,661
did I realize how I felt.

169
00:16:56,550 --> 00:17:00,320
♪The moon wanes and waxes,
lovers part and reunite♪

170
00:17:00,370 --> 00:17:01,160
I thought

171
00:17:01,160 --> 00:17:03,830
♪One moment too late,
love slips from sight♪

172
00:17:03,880 --> 00:17:05,650
we would never meet again.

173
00:17:05,650 --> 00:17:07,650
♪I've tasted the ache
of wanting in vain♪

174
00:17:07,650 --> 00:17:08,970
But I never imagined

175
00:17:08,970 --> 00:17:12,230
♪Time lies sealed beneath clouds
heavy with rain♪

176
00:17:13,010 --> 00:17:14,690
you'd come to Sheng'an to find me.

177
00:17:14,690 --> 00:17:17,020
♪As darkness engulfs the palace
and wildlands sway♪

178
00:17:17,140 --> 00:17:19,600
♪What can I do,
with no one to light the way?♪

179
00:17:19,600 --> 00:17:21,170
From the very beginning,

180
00:17:24,320 --> 00:17:26,760
I've always loved you.

181
00:17:28,970 --> 00:17:30,450
I love you so much.

182
00:17:31,050 --> 00:17:33,010
♪Fate falls just short
of granting our plea♪

183
00:17:33,060 --> 00:17:35,660
♪Yet round we turn, to meet again♪

184
00:17:35,710 --> 00:17:38,410
♪The past dissolves like smoke♪

185
00:17:39,610 --> 00:17:43,330
♪Ask not why longing has no end♪

186
00:17:44,010 --> 00:17:45,120
That's...

187
00:17:45,162 --> 00:17:46,580
♪I pray our years ahead bring peace♪

188
00:17:47,040 --> 00:17:48,040
wonderful to hear.

189
00:17:48,082 --> 00:17:49,710
♪May sorrow end,
though sleepless we lie apart♪

190
00:17:49,760 --> 00:17:52,090
♪Each quietly endures the passing years♪

191
00:17:52,300 --> 00:17:55,240
♪Though close at hand,
we're worlds apart♪

192
00:18:08,600 --> 00:18:09,170
Chunhua,

193
00:18:10,600 --> 00:18:11,280
in a little while,

194
00:18:12,560 --> 00:18:14,650
when all this is over,

195
00:18:15,400 --> 00:18:17,510
♪Why must this world know joy and pain?♪

196
00:18:17,560 --> 00:18:18,320
go back

197
00:18:18,970 --> 00:18:19,930
to your room,

198
00:18:21,840 --> 00:18:22,800
hold Si'er close,

199
00:18:24,730 --> 00:18:25,520
and get

200
00:18:25,562 --> 00:18:27,200
♪The moon wanes and waxes,
lovers part and reunite♪

201
00:18:27,250 --> 00:18:28,080
some good sleep.

202
00:18:28,122 --> 00:18:29,990
♪One moment too late,
love slips from sight♪

203
00:18:30,040 --> 00:18:31,210
Do you understand?

204
00:18:31,930 --> 00:18:34,400
♪I've tasted the ache
of wanting in vain♪

205
00:18:34,450 --> 00:18:35,210
I will.

206
00:18:35,600 --> 00:18:39,310
♪Time lies sealed beneath clouds
heavy with rain♪

207
00:18:40,170 --> 00:18:41,560
You should sleep too, Wenji.

208
00:18:41,602 --> 00:18:44,100
♪As darkness engulfs the palace
and wildlands sway♪

209
00:18:44,220 --> 00:18:46,270
♪What can I do,
with no one to light the way?♪

210
00:18:46,320 --> 00:18:47,170
Do you remember

211
00:18:49,080 --> 00:18:50,600
our little village?

212
00:18:50,642 --> 00:18:54,070
♪Ask not why spring is so hard to leave♪

213
00:18:55,560 --> 00:18:56,800
You'll dream of it.

214
00:18:58,130 --> 00:19:00,090
♪Fate falls just short
of granting our plea♪

215
00:19:00,930 --> 00:19:02,120
I can already

216
00:19:04,010 --> 00:19:05,170
see it.

217
00:19:06,690 --> 00:19:10,360
♪Ask not why longing has no end♪

218
00:19:11,280 --> 00:19:11,800
There are

219
00:19:11,842 --> 00:19:13,510
♪I pray our years ahead bring peace♪

220
00:19:13,560 --> 00:19:14,280
mountains,

221
00:19:14,710 --> 00:19:16,470
♪May sorrow end,
though sleepless we lie apart♪

222
00:19:16,520 --> 00:19:17,410
rivers,

223
00:19:17,452 --> 00:19:19,130
♪Each quietly endures the passing years♪

224
00:19:19,970 --> 00:19:20,520
and...

225
00:19:20,562 --> 00:19:22,350
♪Though close at hand,
we're worlds apart♪

226
00:19:27,120 --> 00:19:29,210
those flowers.

227
00:19:30,110 --> 00:19:32,770
♪One fleeting moment, forever captive♪

228
00:19:33,630 --> 00:19:35,590
♪Fate falls just short
of granting our plea♪

229
00:19:35,640 --> 00:19:38,240
♪Yet round we turn, to meet again♪

230
00:19:38,290 --> 00:19:40,990
♪The past dissolves like smoke♪

231
00:19:42,190 --> 00:19:45,910
♪Ask not why longing has no end♪

232
00:19:46,710 --> 00:19:49,160
♪I pray our years ahead bring peace♪

233
00:19:50,210 --> 00:19:52,290
♪May sorrow end,
though sleepless we lie apart♪

234
00:19:52,340 --> 00:19:54,670
♪Each quietly endures the passing years♪

235
00:19:54,880 --> 00:19:57,820
♪Though close at hand,
we're worlds apart♪

236
00:19:58,880 --> 00:20:05,740
♪Ask not how we've braved power's tides,
through fading grass and setting suns♪

237
00:20:07,160 --> 00:20:10,720
♪Distant memories rise once more♪

238
00:20:11,220 --> 00:20:14,330
♪Could we meet anew in another life?♪

239
00:20:17,790 --> 00:20:22,800
♪How sweet the spring,
how hard to leave♪

240
00:20:31,450 --> 00:20:33,520
The criminal Liu Wenji

241
00:20:34,080 --> 00:20:35,800
committed regicide and treason

242
00:20:36,250 --> 00:20:37,840
and has been executed.

243
00:20:55,210 --> 00:20:57,360
Your Majesty, my condolences!

244
00:20:58,210 --> 00:20:59,120
Ministers, listen carefully!

245
00:21:01,170 --> 00:21:02,210
I have an imperial decree

246
00:21:03,170 --> 00:21:04,320
to proclaim throughout the realm.

247
00:21:08,490 --> 00:21:09,650
Mu Xun, the deposed Crown Prince,

248
00:21:10,930 --> 00:21:11,970
was blessed with imperial favor,

249
00:21:13,490 --> 00:21:14,760
yet raised the banner of rebellion

250
00:21:15,170 --> 00:21:16,360
and attacked the imperial capital,

251
00:21:18,280 --> 00:21:20,040
letting his followers hurt the people.

252
00:21:21,170 --> 00:21:22,210
All officials

253
00:21:22,760 --> 00:21:24,930
must honor the valor of the Grand
Princess, Guardian of the Realm

254
00:21:25,410 --> 00:21:26,730
and the steadfast integrity

255
00:21:27,560 --> 00:21:28,650
of Yan Shang, Commandant of the Guards.

256
00:21:29,490 --> 00:21:30,520
I hereby issue this solemn decree

257
00:21:32,280 --> 00:21:33,410
to every circuit

258
00:21:35,360 --> 00:21:36,170
as a warning

259
00:21:37,280 --> 00:21:38,080
to all.

260
00:21:40,970 --> 00:21:43,760
We obey the Empress Dowager's decree!

261
00:21:54,970 --> 00:21:56,450
Only a hundred more li to Sheng'an.

262
00:21:57,600 --> 00:21:57,930
Change horses.

263
00:21:58,120 --> 00:21:58,360
Yes.

264
00:22:02,560 --> 00:22:03,170
Urgent report!

265
00:22:09,650 --> 00:22:10,120
Your Highness, urgent news!

266
00:22:10,650 --> 00:22:11,730
Everyone inside the city still holds.

267
00:22:12,010 --> 00:22:13,010
The rebels haven't broken through.

268
00:22:14,840 --> 00:22:15,210
But...

269
00:22:15,930 --> 00:22:17,120
the city is out of arrows and food.

270
00:22:17,450 --> 00:22:18,760
Commander Yan died defending the city.

271
00:22:23,840 --> 00:22:24,360
Who...

272
00:22:26,490 --> 00:22:27,210
did you say was killed?

273
00:22:28,040 --> 00:22:28,490
Yan Shang.

274
00:22:29,250 --> 00:22:30,170
Yan Shang, Commandant of the Guards.

275
00:23:21,080 --> 00:23:21,490
Your Highness!

276
00:23:22,970 --> 00:23:23,280
Your Highness!

277
00:23:41,930 --> 00:23:42,410
Go.

278
00:23:44,650 --> 00:23:45,250
Sheng'an

279
00:23:48,490 --> 00:23:49,410
still needs reinforcements.

280
00:23:53,600 --> 00:23:54,080
Give me a hand.

281
00:23:54,410 --> 00:23:54,800
Sir.

282
00:23:55,490 --> 00:23:56,760
Your hands are shaking. Take a break.

283
00:23:57,120 --> 00:23:57,732
- I'll take over.
- I'm not stopping.

284
00:23:58,360 --> 00:23:59,490
We can't let the wall fall.

285
00:24:07,760 --> 00:24:08,690
Here, give that to me.

286
00:24:08,970 --> 00:24:10,210
Look at those injuries on your hands.

287
00:24:10,690 --> 00:24:13,520
We've used up all our arrows and powder.

288
00:24:14,250 --> 00:24:15,360
All we have left are bricks and stones.

289
00:24:16,970 --> 00:24:17,490
Give us a hand.

290
00:24:17,690 --> 00:24:18,520
Come on, come on.

291
00:24:19,320 --> 00:24:19,800
Move.

292
00:24:21,890 --> 00:24:22,170
Come on.

293
00:24:25,010 --> 00:24:25,250
Here.

294
00:24:25,690 --> 00:24:25,989
(Peace Throughout the Realm)
Thank you.

295
00:24:26,031 --> 00:24:26,431
It's fine.

296
00:24:28,450 --> 00:24:28,760
Your Royal Highness.

297
00:24:28,970 --> 00:24:29,730
The new emperor has passed away.

298
00:24:30,010 --> 00:24:31,010
Is the news confirmed?

299
00:24:31,490 --> 00:24:32,120
Without a doubt.

300
00:24:32,320 --> 00:24:33,280
An official report came from Jinzhou.

301
00:24:33,450 --> 00:24:34,120
The funeral has already been held.

302
00:24:34,760 --> 00:24:35,450
Congratulations, Your Royal Highness!

303
00:24:36,360 --> 00:24:37,010
As I thought,

304
00:24:37,600 --> 00:24:38,800
Heaven's mandate is still mine.

305
00:24:42,360 --> 00:24:43,170
Beat the war drums!

306
00:24:51,520 --> 00:24:52,930
The wound is serious.

307
00:24:56,080 --> 00:24:59,080
I wonder if anything else can be done.

308
00:25:00,080 --> 00:25:01,189
It's not getting any better.

309
00:25:01,231 --> 00:25:01,991
Yes.

310
00:25:02,280 --> 00:25:03,259
Do you think Imperial Physician Huang

311
00:25:03,301 --> 00:25:04,991
has any way to treat it?

312
00:25:09,490 --> 00:25:10,560
We must trust the physician.

313
00:25:27,010 --> 00:25:27,760
Attend me.

314
00:25:33,210 --> 00:25:34,210
Is anyone there?

315
00:25:54,800 --> 00:25:55,690
Someone, come!

316
00:26:03,320 --> 00:26:03,930
Your Majesty.

317
00:26:07,360 --> 00:26:08,010
Where is everyone?

318
00:26:09,730 --> 00:26:10,690
Where have they all...

319
00:26:13,800 --> 00:26:14,840
You're crying?

320
00:26:16,970 --> 00:26:17,690
Whatever for?

321
00:26:18,040 --> 00:26:18,560
I've heard

322
00:26:19,360 --> 00:26:20,320
the city gate is about to fall.

323
00:26:22,360 --> 00:26:23,730
And that's why you're crying?

324
00:26:27,170 --> 00:26:30,250
The realm hasn't fallen yet.
Why are you crying?

325
00:26:31,520 --> 00:26:32,800
I'm still here!

326
00:26:58,320 --> 00:26:59,890
Help me get dressed.

327
00:28:02,360 --> 00:28:03,730
Your Royal Highness,
look at the gate tower!

328
00:28:04,970 --> 00:28:05,560
It's His Majesty!

329
00:28:13,320 --> 00:28:14,250
Father.

330
00:28:16,450 --> 00:28:17,840
You haven't fled after all.

331
00:28:18,420 --> 00:28:22,620
(Guanghua Gate)

332
00:28:22,930 --> 00:28:23,600
Mu Xun.

333
00:28:25,600 --> 00:28:26,760
Do you know your crime?

334
00:28:30,600 --> 00:28:31,120
Father,

335
00:28:32,600 --> 00:28:33,930
your precious chosen son

336
00:28:34,800 --> 00:28:36,250
has abandoned the city and fled.

337
00:28:36,600 --> 00:28:37,170
I wonder

338
00:28:38,170 --> 00:28:39,730
what you think of him now.

339
00:28:40,280 --> 00:28:41,280
I think

340
00:28:42,730 --> 00:28:44,690
a coward who flees the city

341
00:28:45,930 --> 00:28:48,600
is better than a monstrous traitor!

342
00:28:53,690 --> 00:28:55,760
If you hadn't taken everything from me,

343
00:28:57,320 --> 00:28:58,520
none of this would have happened.

344
00:28:58,890 --> 00:29:00,250
Ever since you were young,

345
00:29:01,410 --> 00:29:03,450
I taught you military strategy

346
00:29:04,490 --> 00:29:07,520
so that one day you'd defend the realm,

347
00:29:08,280 --> 00:29:11,930
not turn your sword on Sheng'an!

348
00:29:13,840 --> 00:29:14,210
I

349
00:29:15,250 --> 00:29:16,450
have lived a life of mere survival.

350
00:29:18,010 --> 00:29:19,170
I was no great emperor.

351
00:29:20,690 --> 00:29:22,170
But as a ruler,

352
00:29:22,690 --> 00:29:23,690
however incompetent I may be,

353
00:29:24,320 --> 00:29:26,040
I must never turn my army

354
00:29:26,360 --> 00:29:28,320
against my own people!

355
00:29:29,250 --> 00:29:29,890
But you

356
00:29:30,560 --> 00:29:33,450
have plunged our realm into war

357
00:29:34,170 --> 00:29:35,600
and exposed countless innocent people

358
00:29:36,520 --> 00:29:37,560
to its flames!

359
00:29:41,840 --> 00:29:43,210
Traitors and rebels

360
00:29:43,840 --> 00:29:45,650
deserve to die at everyone's hands!

361
00:30:02,730 --> 00:30:03,280
Urgent report, Your Royal Highness!

362
00:30:03,490 --> 00:30:05,760
Princess Danyang leads
the North Jing cavalry

363
00:30:06,250 --> 00:30:07,210
and provincial troops.
They're 50 li away!

364
00:30:10,580 --> 00:30:13,220
(Guanghua Gate)

365
00:30:21,730 --> 00:30:22,280
Fall back!

366
00:30:24,520 --> 00:30:25,410
Retreat!

367
00:30:32,620 --> 00:30:35,060
(Guanghua Gate)

368
00:30:56,760 --> 00:30:57,080
Your Majesty.

369
00:30:57,250 --> 00:30:57,629
Your Majesty.

370
00:30:57,671 --> 00:31:00,551
(Guanghua Gate)

371
00:31:00,600 --> 00:31:01,280
I'm fine.

372
00:31:02,360 --> 00:31:03,450
You've all endured enough.

373
00:31:06,080 --> 00:31:07,080
Go on. Leave me.

374
00:32:50,360 --> 00:32:54,410
Your Majesty! Your Majesty!

375
00:33:25,060 --> 00:33:26,300
(Huai)

376
00:33:59,320 --> 00:34:00,970
I knew she'd seek reinforcements,

377
00:34:01,450 --> 00:34:02,970
but I didn't expect them so soon.

378
00:34:03,410 --> 00:34:04,120
How many are there?

379
00:34:04,600 --> 00:34:05,560
Perhaps a hundred thousand.

380
00:34:07,760 --> 00:34:08,850
Go negotiate with Mu Wanyao.

381
00:34:09,560 --> 00:34:10,160
Get her to stop her troops.

382
00:34:11,850 --> 00:34:12,200
Your Royal Highness,

383
00:34:12,930 --> 00:34:14,010
I volunteer to go.

384
00:34:15,770 --> 00:34:16,640
If the talks fail,

385
00:34:17,560 --> 00:34:18,560
I'll accept any military punishment.

386
00:34:22,520 --> 00:34:23,120
Tan Yuanchun!

387
00:34:24,200 --> 00:34:24,520
Here!

388
00:34:25,330 --> 00:34:25,770
You go.

389
00:34:26,560 --> 00:34:26,850
Yes!

390
00:34:59,890 --> 00:35:01,810
I'm here on the Crown Prince's behalf

391
00:35:02,120 --> 00:35:03,890
to speak to the Princess Danyang,
Guardian of the Realm.

392
00:35:09,120 --> 00:35:11,370
You and your brother
have many misunderstandings.

393
00:35:12,010 --> 00:35:12,970
As an outsider,

394
00:35:13,410 --> 00:35:14,160
it's not my place to interfere.

395
00:35:14,600 --> 00:35:15,810
But there's one thing

396
00:35:16,200 --> 00:35:17,490
I must tell Your Highness.

397
00:35:18,330 --> 00:35:19,200
Yan Shang...

398
00:35:19,330 --> 00:35:19,680
Shut up!

399
00:35:21,200 --> 00:35:22,370
How dare you say his name?

400
00:35:23,040 --> 00:35:23,520
Your Highness,

401
00:35:24,160 --> 00:35:25,120
Yan Shang is alive.

402
00:35:33,890 --> 00:35:34,600
What did you say?

403
00:35:35,520 --> 00:35:37,160
Commander Yan was wounded and captured,

404
00:35:37,490 --> 00:35:38,200
but he's alive.

405
00:35:38,640 --> 00:35:40,410
He's in the Crown Prince's tent.

406
00:35:48,520 --> 00:35:50,850
You hardly know me, General Tan.

407
00:35:52,450 --> 00:35:53,290
So you have no idea

408
00:35:54,010 --> 00:35:55,040
what happens to those

409
00:35:55,890 --> 00:35:56,970
who dare lie to me.

410
00:35:58,890 --> 00:36:00,240
Yan Shang is alive.

411
00:36:00,930 --> 00:36:02,040
You'll see for yourself, Your Highness.

412
00:36:03,120 --> 00:36:04,720
If you agree to withdraw your troops

413
00:36:05,120 --> 00:36:06,720
and discuss affairs
with the Crown Prince,

414
00:36:07,450 --> 00:36:10,560
he'll guarantee Yan Shang's safety.

415
00:36:15,560 --> 00:36:16,490
You say he's alive.

416
00:36:19,160 --> 00:36:19,850
What proof do you have?

417
00:36:20,160 --> 00:36:20,810
If you don't believe me,

418
00:36:21,160 --> 00:36:22,520
come with me and see him yourself.

419
00:36:23,080 --> 00:36:23,890
Your Highness, you mustn't.

420
00:36:24,680 --> 00:36:25,120
Your Highness,

421
00:36:25,640 --> 00:36:26,680
Yan Shang is gravely wounded.

422
00:36:27,290 --> 00:36:27,850
Seeing you

423
00:36:28,560 --> 00:36:30,200
would surely give him the will to live.

424
00:36:32,200 --> 00:36:33,040
How badly wounded?

425
00:36:34,850 --> 00:36:35,290
So badly

426
00:36:36,770 --> 00:36:37,850
he couldn't even send me a token?

427
00:36:40,810 --> 00:36:41,450
He sent a message.

428
00:36:42,160 --> 00:36:45,330
Several words for you, Your Highness.

429
00:36:46,560 --> 00:36:47,810
Patience will bring things right.

430
00:36:48,450 --> 00:36:49,520
There is still time ahead.

431
00:36:55,040 --> 00:36:55,520
Your Highness,

432
00:36:56,410 --> 00:36:58,200
once the Crown Prince
takes Taiji Palace,

433
00:36:58,890 --> 00:37:00,290
he'll let you keep your title

434
00:37:00,930 --> 00:37:02,290
and let you choose your own fief.

435
00:37:06,410 --> 00:37:07,160
What fief?

436
00:37:08,410 --> 00:37:09,290
My home

437
00:37:09,770 --> 00:37:10,520
is here in Sheng'an!

438
00:37:10,970 --> 00:37:11,410
Your Highness,

439
00:37:11,850 --> 00:37:12,659
every word I've said is true...

440
00:37:12,701 --> 00:37:14,061
Say one more word,

441
00:37:14,970 --> 00:37:16,010
and I'll have you cut to pieces!

442
00:37:17,640 --> 00:37:18,040
Take him away!

443
00:37:30,890 --> 00:37:31,240
Your Highness,

444
00:37:32,770 --> 00:37:33,560
do you think that messenger

445
00:37:34,770 --> 00:37:35,330
was telling the truth?

446
00:37:45,600 --> 00:37:46,810
If Yan Shang really had been captured,

447
00:37:50,080 --> 00:37:51,240
he would have kept his mouth shut.

448
00:37:54,520 --> 00:37:55,770
He'd never have sent me a single word.

449
00:37:57,370 --> 00:37:58,120
So...

450
00:37:59,160 --> 00:38:00,770
Yan Shang really is...

451
00:38:00,970 --> 00:38:01,290
Gu Han.

452
00:38:11,640 --> 00:38:12,370
(Mu Xun.)

453
00:38:13,930 --> 00:38:15,410
(You're asking for it.)

454
00:38:23,450 --> 00:38:23,770
Your Royal Highness!

455
00:38:24,290 --> 00:38:25,080
His Majesty has passed away.

456
00:38:29,080 --> 00:38:29,930
Father...

457
00:38:33,930 --> 00:38:34,770
He's already...

458
00:38:40,240 --> 00:38:40,680
Your Royal Highness,

459
00:38:41,450 --> 00:38:42,200
we can't miss this chance.

460
00:38:43,240 --> 00:38:43,810
Let's attack the city.

461
00:38:48,770 --> 00:38:49,680
Attack the city.

462
00:38:53,200 --> 00:38:54,080
Attack!

463
00:39:52,260 --> 00:39:53,320
(Guanghua Gate)

464
00:40:12,240 --> 00:40:13,290
All troops, heed my command!

465
00:40:14,970 --> 00:40:15,890
Follow me and crush the rebels!

466
00:40:16,490 --> 00:40:17,010
Beat the drums!

467
00:40:18,540 --> 00:40:20,580
(Huai)

468
00:40:23,010 --> 00:40:26,940
Kill! Kill!

469
00:40:26,990 --> 00:40:30,970
Kill! Kill!

470
00:40:31,120 --> 00:40:31,930
- Those who yield shall live!
- Kill! Kill!

471
00:40:32,560 --> 00:40:33,429
- Those who resist shall die!
- Kill!

472
00:40:33,471 --> 00:40:37,438
Kill! Kill!

473
00:40:37,480 --> 00:40:41,520
Kill! Kill!

474
00:41:19,330 --> 00:41:19,810
(Yan Shang,)

475
00:41:20,890 --> 00:41:21,810
(get over here this instant!)

476
00:42:02,540 --> 00:42:06,980
♪A bamboo basket brims with lychees♪

477
00:42:07,620 --> 00:42:11,300
♪At dusk, our little boat drifts along♪

478
00:42:12,220 --> 00:42:17,060
♪Sunset clouds crown the treetops♪

479
00:42:17,060 --> 00:42:21,020
♪We drift on beyond twilight♪

480
00:42:21,820 --> 00:42:26,300
♪Words fail me over this cup of wine♪

481
00:42:26,780 --> 00:42:30,100
♪I still fear my ambitions
may go unfulfilled♪

482
00:42:31,060 --> 00:42:39,380
♪Pour out my cup and stir up the sea♪

483
00:43:07,290 --> 00:43:10,330
Your Royal Highness,
must this go on even now?

484
00:43:11,080 --> 00:43:11,850
On the battlefield,

485
00:43:12,850 --> 00:43:13,640
we fight until one side dies!

486
00:43:14,720 --> 00:43:15,970
We never had a choice!

487
00:43:17,450 --> 00:43:17,890
Yang Si,

488
00:43:18,970 --> 00:43:19,490
tonight,

489
00:43:20,290 --> 00:43:21,240
come with me

490
00:43:22,010 --> 00:43:23,080
and break through this city gate!

491
00:43:35,600 --> 00:43:37,080
(I'll put an end to all of this.)

492
00:43:46,240 --> 00:43:47,560
Yang Si!

493
00:43:48,930 --> 00:43:49,520
Come back...

494
00:44:51,140 --> 00:44:55,780
(Next Episode Preview)

495
00:44:55,850 --> 00:44:56,600
As a child,

496
00:44:57,370 --> 00:44:59,330
I used to imagine my wedding day.

497
00:44:59,720 --> 00:45:00,410
Later,

498
00:45:01,160 --> 00:45:03,450
I thought I'd never want to marry.

499
00:45:04,080 --> 00:45:06,120
I never thought I'd be lucky enough

500
00:45:07,080 --> 00:45:08,490
to marry her in this life.

501
00:45:09,850 --> 00:45:10,810
The ceremony is complete.

502
00:45:14,921 --> 00:45:18,214
♪Be the ferry
where you wait for the sun♪

503
00:45:20,899 --> 00:45:25,815
♪Be the blue silk
that catches your tears♪

504
00:45:28,009 --> 00:45:33,854
♪Be the sleeve we held,
worn by dust and years♪

505
00:45:34,354 --> 00:45:39,580
♪Let's conspire to grow old together♪

506
00:45:42,349 --> 00:45:47,140
♪Let me be a captive beast
bound by the same lock as you♪

507
00:45:47,976 --> 00:45:54,055
♪- Through trails of mud and blood;
- let grief drown in your eyes♪

508
00:45:55,856 --> 00:45:59,006
♪Soar with the wind;
plunge into hellfire as one♪

509
00:45:59,006 --> 00:46:00,654
♪Burning bright as a song♪

510
00:46:00,706 --> 00:46:04,430
♪See how roses and green bamboo enchant♪

511
00:46:04,808 --> 00:46:09,474
♪Be the vow I make with all my heart♪

512
00:46:10,093 --> 00:46:14,134
♪If we say forever,
then forever it shall be♪

513
00:46:14,625 --> 00:46:16,740
♪Not a single hour less♪

514
00:46:16,780 --> 00:46:23,726
♪However deep the snow,
I'll wait if you're there♪

515
00:46:24,489 --> 00:46:27,942
♪We'll be gods above,
or wandering souls♪

516
00:46:28,122 --> 00:46:31,267
♪In heaven or the underworld,
you're all I need♪

517
00:46:31,706 --> 00:46:38,343
♪If we can stay, let's return
to the village of our first meeting♪

518
00:46:38,740 --> 00:46:40,778
♪- May time be free of fear;
- boats rock♪

519
00:46:40,778 --> 00:46:43,254
♪- May time be free of pain;
- lights fade, seasons turn♪

520
00:46:43,292 --> 00:46:45,761
♪You're the only one I need♪

521
00:46:45,965 --> 00:46:52,852
♪Sharp winds or fierce rain,
nothing can break us♪

522
00:46:53,164 --> 00:46:56,435
♪Be mine in this world;
be mine in this life♪

523
00:46:56,740 --> 00:46:59,913
♪My last untouched innocence♪

524
00:47:00,237 --> 00:47:03,663
♪If only we could return
to the village where we first met♪

525
00:47:03,896 --> 00:47:07,121
♪Stay by me; help me forget
the frozen dream of last night♪

526
00:47:07,452 --> 00:47:14,248
♪Fireflies glow, flowers kiss our lips;
just us, through dawn and dusk♪

527
00:47:14,617 --> 00:47:16,679
♪- May time be free of fear;
- boats rock♪

528
00:47:16,680 --> 00:47:19,183
♪- May time be free of pain;
- lights fade, seasons turn♪

529
00:47:19,230 --> 00:47:21,568
♪You're the only one I need♪

530
00:47:21,799 --> 00:47:28,634
♪By your side, through joy and pain,
is that eternity?♪

531
00:47:28,983 --> 00:47:30,601
♪Till fireworks flood the town♪

532
00:47:30,731 --> 00:47:32,527
♪Till the lake is still and clear♪

533
00:47:32,884 --> 00:47:35,901
♪You're the only one I need♪

534
00:47:35,941 --> 00:47:37,268
(No animals were harmed
or mistreated in production.)

